    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fa3479d7_f5e6f215",
        "filename": "voltha/adapters/asfvolt16_olt/asfvolt16_device_handler.py",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 220,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000115
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-08-02T23:12:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This check for 65536 needs some comments in the code.  It is not an actual onu_id.  From conversation with Steve Crooks, this code is to deal with discovery and auto-provisioning of ONUs.  When ONU is discovered if the discovered ONU is not already registered in Maple, the ONU discovered indication contains ONU_ID of 65536.  This code avoids trying to re-provision the ONU with a new ONU_ID while an earlier ONU activation was still in progress.\n\nRaghu, please add some comments to this effect.",
      "parentUuid": "fa3479d7_95ba0609",
      "revId": "538cbd4c200ce0e0dc281579c46f8c97215ddcb4",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fa3479d7_952b2694",
        "filename": "voltha/adapters/asfvolt16_olt/asfvolt16_device_handler.py",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 220,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000074
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-08-03T12:48:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Just want to clarify the above. As Kim indicated when ONU is discovered if the discovered ONU is not already registered in Maple, the ONU discovered indication contains ONU_ID of 65536.\n\nThe code that did auto-discovery and provisioning of ONUs did check for this value, along with the vendor/serial number, to determine if the ONU had already been discovered and an activation in progress.\n\nGiven the move away from auto-provisioning and activation towards provisioning via voltha, an ONU discover message with an ONU ID of 65535 means an ONU was discovered on the PON that has not been provisioned/registered with the Maple (not an ONU with activation already in progress).\n\nHow should we handle ONUs that are discovered on the PON that have not been provisioned? Raise an alarm, throttle the notification, do nothing until provisioned and then activate?",
      "parentUuid": "fa3479d7_f5e6f215",
      "revId": "538cbd4c200ce0e0dc281579c46f8c97215ddcb4",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fa3479d7_551dbe72",
        "filename": "voltha/adapters/asfvolt16_olt/asfvolt16_device_handler.py",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 220,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000099
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-08-03T13:05:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right now we are doing nothing until it\u0027s provisioned.",
      "parentUuid": "fa3479d7_952b2694",
      "revId": "538cbd4c200ce0e0dc281579c46f8c97215ddcb4",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fa3479d7_f524b2c7",
        "filename": "voltha/adapters/asfvolt16_olt/asfvolt16_device_handler.py",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 220,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000099
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-08-03T13:05:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "As soon as OLT detects new ONUS, BAL/Maple assigns 65536 as ONU ID and gives indication to VOLTHA. If VOLTHA receives this indication on ONU which is discovered state, we use ONU ID 65536 to avoid reactivation on ONU again.",
      "parentUuid": "fa3479d7_f5e6f215",
      "revId": "538cbd4c200ce0e0dc281579c46f8c97215ddcb4",
      "serverId": "2a2bfe1b-c5c2-48ed-9ac8-16438ab24388",
      "unresolved": false
    },
